<section id="facets" class="py-24 bg-stone-50/50 border-y border-stone-200/50">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="text-center mb-14">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.28em] text-hk-accent mb-4">HOME OVERVIEW</p>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-hk-primary mb-4">核心身份与信任背书</h2>
            <p class="text-stone-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">我是一位爸爸、一位丈夫、也是一位企业顾问。比起头衔，更希望成为一个让人感到信任的人。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr] gap-8 items-stretch">
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-stone-100">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-black mb-4 text-hk-primary">From Factory Floor to Regional Strategy</h3>
                <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
                    从中国工厂一线，到跨境贸易、电商平台、东南亚建厂，再到协助企业设计 1+1 全球化策略。一路实践后我更相信：长期主义与可执行，才是穿越周期的底层能力。
                </p>
                <a href="/about-brendon" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full border border-hk-primary text-hk-primary text-sm font-bold hover:bg-hk-primary hover:text-white transition">
